isible. The image cuts off later passage text below Q25; that does not appear to truncate Q24."], "status": "ai_proposal_unreviewed"}, "transcription_checked": null, "segmentation_checked": null, "passage_link_checked": null, "rationale": null, "integration_status": "accepted_pending_application", "independent_validation_pilot": false}
